=== Stored Energy ===

From the ψ stress-energy tensor (established in [[Psionics]] and [[ψ Quality Factor]] B5):

:<math>U_\psi = \int_V T^{00}_\psi\,d^3x = \int_V \left[\tfrac{1}{2}(\partial_t\psi)^2 + \tfrac{1}{2}|\nabla\psi|^2 + \tfrac{1}{2}m_{\rm eff}^2\psi^2 + \tfrac{\lambda}{4}\psi^4\right]d^3x</math>

At resonance, energy shuttles between the kinetic term <math>\tfrac{1}{2}(\partial_t\psi)^2</math> and the potential terms <math>\tfrac{1}{2}|\nabla\psi|^2 + \tfrac{1}{2}m_{\rm eff}^2\psi^2</math> — exactly as in a harmonic oscillator. The time-averaged stored energy is constant at steady state.

